<title>ARGENTINA: Perez Companc Q1 net $74.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Perez Companc Q1 net $74.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to November 30. Net $74.1 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Industrial and energy holding Perez Companc SA said at November 30 its net worth stood at $1.71 billion. It did not report EPS.</p>
<p>((-Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
